All adapted and ported files have been rewritten for a pure-Node MCP server.

img2threejs does not publish a standalone ObjectSculptSpec JSON Schema. The file
schema/object-sculpt-spec.runtime.schema.json is therefore an MCP-specific runtime
contract for the subset this server consumes; it is not represented as an upstream file.

All upstream grimoire files remain in this source distribution for license and audit
fidelity. The MCP resource catalog intentionally excludes retained pages that contain
concrete fenced GLSL or material recipes, so the server serves technique without becoming
the author of a game's look.
